            <note corresp="#d350-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d350-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL 27 LAOS. Top Secret. For the
                    additional drafting information on this study, see <ref target="#d348">Document
                        348</ref>. Sent also to Steadman, Special Assistant to Clifford, and on
                    April 2 to Taylor at the White House. (Department of State, Central Files, DEF
                    1–1 LAOS)</p>
            </note>
